            "sid": "GEN 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Huji 7.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufuuni hojattu ufii durati ufi d'owu dad'abe jennaani waan jed'eeni, Isani ch'ufti na biraa baha. Tanaafi yo inni oboleyaani isaa ufi beesise, nami tokoleeni isa bira injiru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni aka taka inargini bohe jennaani worri Misiri ch'ufti d'agaye, oduuni suni mana Faraoleeni baate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufuuni waan oboleyaani isaatini jed'e, Anini Yusufu. Aabbooni d'uguma ammalle injira? Waan kana d'ageennaani oboleyaani isaa mudamte waan jettule d'abde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani Yusufuuni waan jed'eeni, Me gadi hiiqa. Worri iti hiiqe jennaani inni waan jed'eeni, Anini oboleesa keesani Yusufu, ka isani bunat'u lafa Misiriti gurgurtani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan na gurgurtani amma ilaalefatina, yokhaani wollaali keenna injed'ina. Waaqumati isani dura na erge, aka anini lubbu biyyaa baasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganni beela Kanaani wolti lama, shani d'ibiti hafa, ka nami qote imfach'aamne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqumati isani dura na erge, aka anini hidda keesani badi d'owe, ilmaani teesani beela iraa haftu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi Waaqa male, namu asi na inergine. Inni ya abba mala gudda ka Farao na tolche, hojattuuni isaa ch'ufti na jala jirti, finni lafa Misiri ch'ufti harka kiyya keesa jira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Huji 7.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma hurrisa, gara aabbo dachaa waan jettaniini, Wonti ilmi kanke Yusufuuni siini jed'u tana: Waaqi ya gudda lafa Misiri ch'ufa na tolche, inturiini, nati kooti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka nati d'iaattu, lafa Gosheni keesa teetu — sii, ilmaani teeti, akhakhowani teeti, ree teeti, looni keeti, wonti atini qabdu ch'ufti lafa suni teeti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo atini lafa Gosheni keesa teete, anini dandae si qorqorad'a, ganni beela shani d'ibiti hafa, anini worra keetifi hori kanke ka beelaani hobau imfed'u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amma tana isaniini ch'ufti, atileeni Benjamini, aka anini Yusufu ya argitani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka anini lafa Misiri keesa irre qabuufi waan agartani ch'ufa aabbooti hima. Duuba hurrisa, isa armaani koota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani inni oboleesa ufii Benjamini mamarate bohe, Benjaminileeni akasuma iti mamarate bohe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba ato bohu jiru, oboleyaani isaa taani ch'ufa ira deeme iti mamarate d'ungate. Eegi suni oboleyaani aka dansaa haasoofteeni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oduuni d'ufiisa oboleyaani Yusufu worra Farao geennaani Faraoni hojattuuni isaa gammadde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Faraoni waan Yusufuuni jed'e, Oboleyaani tanteetiini harrele faad'a, Kanaaniti gala jed'iini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abba keesanifi worra keesani ch'ufa fud'ad'a gadi godaana. Duuba fulla lafa Misiri ch'ufa keesa ira dansa isanii kenna, aka isani quuftani gabbattani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle waan jettuuni, Gaari horiini hirkisani fud'ad'a, aka ijoollefi nad'eeni teesani yaabatuu; abba keesanile fuud'a, koota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan miha keesani iyyaaliina, biyyeeni lafa Misiri keesa ch'ufa ira dansa teesani taati jed'iini jed'e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilmaani Yakobo akuma jed'aniini taate. Yusufuleeni akuma Faraoni jed'eeni, gaari horiini hirkisufi woreega karale kenneefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni oboleyaani isaa ch'ufa woya haraa kenneefi, ammo Benjamini qarsi d'ibba saditiifi woya haraa shani kenneefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abba isaale harrele kud'ani, ta waan dadansa lafa Misiri baatu, ammalle kud'ani d'ibi, ta mid'aanifi qit'afi woreega karaa baatu ergeefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oboleyaani isaa deema kaate jennaani d'aamate waan jed'e, Karaati woli indidina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba lafa Misiriti yaani, lafa Kanaani fulla abbaani jiruuni bahani waan jed'aniini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yusufuuni ammalle injira, amma isuma lafa Misiri ch'ufa guddaani iti isa. Dubbini suni Yakobo mamsiifte, inni d'ugefachu dide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo waan Yusufuuni jed'e ch'ufa d'agaye ammalle gaari horiini hirkisu, ka isa jed'ani lafa Misiri keesaa ergani arge jennaani mama kaanile baafate waan jed'e, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
